# Unreal Engine plugin local ignores.
# UE generates these at build time; the repo should never commit them.

# Compiled binaries and intermediate build data
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Build/

# Unreal-generated module/DLL metadata
*.modules
*.target
*.autogen.cpp
*.generated.*
*.gen.cpp
*.gen.h

# Rider / Clion / IDE
.idea/
.vs/
*.sln
*.suo
*.vcxproj
*.filters
*.user
